PROMPT ENGINEERING TECHNIQUES -

    How the prompt cache works?
        Also put the dynamic values at last in prompt, because prompt will be cached from the starting of user input
        and till the point there is dynamic value. If the dynamic value is there in the starting only... it will never
        cache.

    All gemini models will anto cache, for claude models we have to activate the cache

